 "unhandled_root_fields": {
  "description": "NECROMANCER (necromancer.bbmodel)  -  notes\n============================================================\nScale 1 unit = 2.8125 cm. Origin between the feet at y=0, faces -Z, creature right = +X.\n\nSIZE\n  Cubes: 40 (budget \u226440 people), texture 256x256 embedded, 1 texel/unit.\n  Height: crown tip y=71.0 (= 2.00 m). Skull top y=67.1. Documented height = crown tip.\n  Thin undead mage silhouette. No team colour (hostile/NPC mage).\n\nHIT BOX (W x H x D, units; centred on x=0)\n  Main body: 23 x 71 x 25  (robe widest, crown tip).\n  (= 0.66 x 2.00 x 0.69 m). Staff excluded from hit box.\n\nMOVE SPEEDS (in-place cycles)\n  walk: 39.1 units/s = 1.10 m/s, cycle 1.20 s, stride 46.9 units\n  run : 78.2 units/s = 2.20 m/s, cycle 0.75 s, stride 58.7 units\n\nCLIPS (name, length, loop mode, events)\n  idle             3.000 s  loop \n      loop ~3s; breathe/sway, skull tilt; mid-staff pole carry mostly horizontal (tip fwd/slightly up)\n  walk             1.200 s  loop \n      undead robe-shuffle gait (feet stay under hem; game speed 1.10 m/s); mid-staff horizontal carry\n  run              0.750 s  loop \n      faster robe-shuffle run (feet under hem; game speed 2.20 m/s); mid-staff carry tipped forward\n  attack_spell     1.800 s  once   KEY = 0.85 s\n      ranged cast from mid-pole carry; KEY bolt leaves tip at 0.85s; tip world offset at key \u2248 (23.6, 34.6, -31.1); left hand on forward shaft during cast; recovers to horizontal carry\n  summon           2.800 s  once   KEY = 1.40 s\n      ritual cast from mid-pole carry; staff raised upright, both hands channel; KEY summon pop at 1.40s; distinct from attack_spell\n  injured          0.600 s  once \n      flinch from front, peak ~0.08 s, back to idle by 0.6 s; staff stays gripped\n  death            2.400 s  hold \n      collapses forward; staff drops at 0.20s (world-fixed fall); body lands ~1.60s; holds last frame on y=0 (min y=-0.00)\n  attack_spell tip world offset at KEY (bolt spawn): (23.6, 34.6, -31.1)\n  Key times also keyframed on root bone and stored as animation markers.\n\nATTACHMENT POINTS (empty groups, pivot in rest pose)\n  slot_head        parent head             pivot (0.0, 69.3, 0.0)\n  slot_back        parent torso            pivot (0.0, 47.0, 5.0)\n  slot_quiver      parent torso            pivot (3.4, 51.4, 5.0)\n  slot_shoulder_r  parent torso            pivot (4.5, 57.0, 0.0)\n  slot_carry       parent torso            pivot (0.0, 44.7, -5.0)\n  slot_hand_r      parent hand_r           pivot (7.8, 30.7, 0.0)\n  slot_shield_l    parent arm_lower_l      pivot (-11.2, 38.6, 0.0)\n  slot_hand_l      parent hand_l           pivot (-7.8, 30.7, 0.0)\n  slot_hip_r       parent hips             pivot (6.7, 34.7, 3.4)\n  slot_hip_l       parent hips             pivot (-6.7, 34.7, 3.4)\n\nSTAFF (bone \"staff\" under slot_hand_r, pivot = grip = slot_hand_r pivot)\n  Wooden/bone staff with gold collar + glow_staff_tip crystal. Length 48 units.\n  GRIP AT MIDPOINT (origin). Tip toward -Z (~22.9 units), butt/pommel toward +Z.\n  Rest/idle/walk/run: mostly-horizontal mid-pole carry (tip forward/slightly up, butt behind);\n  slight natural tilt \u2014 not a planted walking stick, not locked perfectly flat.\n  Second hand during casts: ~9\u201310 units toward tip from mid-grip.\n  glow_staff_tip and glow_eye_r/l are named for in-game lighting.\n\nSKELETON\n  Baseline names: root > hips > torso > head (> slot_head); arm_upper/arm_lower/hand _r/_l;\n  leg_upper/leg_lower/foot _r/_l; slots as listed. Extra bone: staff.\n\nSPELL BOLT (necromancer_bolt.bbmodel) \u2014 separate file\n  See necromancer_bolt_notes section below / necromancer_bolt_notes.txt.\n\nCONVENTIONS / CAVEATS\n  - Rotation signs follow reference files (Bedrock-style X/Y negation).\n  - Loco cycles are in place; death moves the body forward (root position) as it falls.\n  - Staff drop on death is baked world-fixed (like bog guardian club).\n  - Arm IK for two-hand casts uses quat-near Euler unwrapping to avoid wrap snaps.\n  - Death final min body y \u2248 -0.00 (target 0).\n"
 },
 "resolution": {
  "width": 256,
  "height": 256
 },
